WEBVTT

1
00:47:20.994 --> 00:47:23.994
Hallelujah!

2
00:47:50.994 --> 00:47:56.994
Coming to me, because two people walked up to me with a specific prayer that it's exactly about.

3
00:47:56.994 --> 00:48:03.994
So, P-man and his wife, could you please come up here for a moment.

4
00:48:03.994 --> 00:48:15.994
I want to pray for Iran. I want to pray together for Iran, because what is happening there in the past few days is just hell.

5
00:48:15.994 --> 00:48:20.994
And I want to pray for that together. And I find it nice if we come together powerfully in prayer.

6
00:48:20.994 --> 00:48:31.994
And listen well, people, whenever you see things happening in the world, do not look at the political nature of what is happening.

7
00:48:31.994 --> 00:48:37.994
But look at whether the gospel can take root in that country.

8
00:48:37.994 --> 00:48:43.994
Are the people free in a country? That is the core of every message.

9
00:48:43.994 --> 00:48:51.994
Do not think about what geopolitics is doing. How the reasons and how the news looks at things.

10
00:48:51.994 --> 00:48:59.994
But do not look at what the numbers say. One news report says that in Iran in the past week 2000 people have died.

11
00:48:59.994 --> 00:49:02.994
Other reports say 20,000 people.

12
00:49:02.994 --> 00:49:13.994
And again there are reports and video footage that the state police are literally opening fire on people who come out to protest.

13
00:49:13.994 --> 00:49:16.994
That people are just being shot point blank.

14
00:49:16.994 --> 00:49:21.994
And this is just hell. And we need to pray for this.

15
00:49:21.994 --> 00:49:25.994
So I would appreciate it if we could close our eyes.

16
00:49:25.994 --> 00:49:31.994
Peeman, come stand here for a moment, because where I will be talking about, there are more people from Iran here.

17
00:49:31.994 --> 00:49:36.994
A few years ago we really had a lot of people from Iran in our church.

18
00:49:36.994 --> 00:49:38.994
We were able to baptize them in the name of Jesus.

19
00:49:38.994 --> 00:49:42.994
And Peeman and his wife and father Jan were also here when they came to this church.

20
00:49:42.994 --> 00:49:44.994
And they are still here with us.

21
00:49:44.994 --> 00:49:49.994
And just before the service, he came to me and said, Tim, can we please pray for Iran.

22
00:49:49.994 --> 00:49:52.994
Because what is happening is terrible. It is literally terrible.

23
00:49:52.994 --> 00:50:00.994
And I don't care. On the NOS, I sometimes see them say, yes, this uprising is due to inflation.

24
00:50:00.994 --> 00:50:02.994
It has nothing to do with inflation.

25
00:50:02.994 --> 00:50:04.994
Even though that inflation is terrible.

26
00:50:04.994 --> 00:50:09.994
If a loaf of bread costs 50 euros, then we all have a big problem together.

27
00:50:09.994 --> 00:50:11.994
So I understand that there are protests because of that.

28
00:50:11.994 --> 00:50:17.994
But the real protests are about oppression, oppression, and oppression.

29
00:50:17.994 --> 00:50:19.994
And that is what we are going to pray for now.

30
00:50:19.994 --> 00:50:20.994
So can we close our eyes.

31
00:50:20.994 --> 00:50:23.994
Christians, can we come in prayer, please.

32
00:50:23.994 --> 00:50:25.994
Can we intercede in the name of Jesus.

33
00:50:26.994 --> 00:50:31.994
Can we perhaps stretch out our hands towards Peyam and this family.

34
00:50:31.994 --> 00:50:36.994
And can we pray for freedom in the name of Jesus.

35
00:50:36.994 --> 00:50:46.994
At this moment, we come together to pray in the name of Jesus for the freedom of the country Iran in the name of King Jesus.

36
00:50:47.994 --> 00:50:55.994
We pray that every regime that is turned against the name of Jesus will fall in the name of Jesus.

37
00:50:55.994 --> 00:51:03.994
We pray in the name of Jesus for freedom and freedom and freedom over this land in Jesus' name.

38
00:51:03.994 --> 00:51:09.994
We pray that people will receive angelic protection through angels.

39
00:51:09.994 --> 00:51:18.994
I pray for angels who will descend and provide protection to the underground church in Iran in the name of Jesus.

40
00:51:18.994 --> 00:51:23.994
Lord, I pray that the gospel will break through in this country in the name of Jesus.

41
00:51:23.994 --> 00:51:28.994
Lord, I pray that Islam will fall in this country in the name of Jesus.

42
00:51:28.994 --> 00:51:35.994
Lord, I pray in the name of Jesus that the people will truly be free through the mighty name of King Jesus.

43
00:51:35.994 --> 00:51:42.994
Lord, I want to pray that the church in Iran will receive extra supernatural protection.

44
00:51:42.994 --> 00:51:51.994
Lord, I want to pray that the church in Iran will receive extra wisdom through the Holy Spirit to push the gospel forward at this moment.

45
00:51:51.994 --> 00:51:53.994
In Jesus' mighty name.

46
00:51:53.994 --> 00:51:57.994
Lord, we pray for freedom for Iran in the name of Jesus.

47
00:51:57.994 --> 00:52:02.994
I proclaim freedom for Iran in the name of Jesus.

48
00:52:02.994 --> 00:52:03.994
In the name of Jesus.

49
00:52:03.994 --> 00:52:04.994
In the name of Jesus.

50
00:52:04.994 --> 00:52:12.994
Lord, I also want to pray that when freedom comes, Satan will not run away with this freedom.

51
00:52:12.994 --> 00:52:16.994
What we saw happen 500 years ago.

52
00:52:16.994 --> 00:52:21.994
When freedom comes to a country, even then Satan can do something.

53
00:52:21.994 --> 00:52:25.994
With that, Satan can bring forth liberalism as the next branch.

54
00:52:25.994 --> 00:52:27.994
But we do not pray for that.

55
00:52:27.994 --> 00:52:28.994
We do not pray for liberalism.

56
00:52:28.994 --> 00:52:31.994
We pray for the repentance of King Jesus.

57
00:52:31.994 --> 00:52:35.994
We pray that people will give their hearts to King Jesus.

58
00:52:35.994 --> 00:52:38.994
Lord, we give this country back to King Jesus.

59
00:52:38.994 --> 00:52:44.994
Lord, we pray that Iran will be returned to King Jesus.

60
00:52:44.994 --> 00:52:48.994
We pray that this country will repent in the name of Jesus Christ.

61
00:52:48.994 --> 00:52:54.994
For the Bible says that when people come to repentance and humble themselves before the Lord.

62
00:52:54.994 --> 00:52:57.994
Then the Lord can heal the land.

63
00:52:57.994 --> 00:52:59.994
Then inflation will stop.

64
00:52:59.994 --> 00:53:01.994
Then poverty will stop.

65
00:53:01.994 --> 00:53:04.994
For where Jesus is, there is true freedom.

66
00:53:04.994 --> 00:53:08.994
And so I pray that Iran will come into freedom.

67
00:53:08.994 --> 00:53:11.994
In the mighty name of Jesus.

68
00:53:11.994 --> 00:53:13.994
In the mighty name of Jesus.

69
00:53:13.994 --> 00:53:14.994
Amen.

70
00:53:14.994 --> 00:53:15.994
Amen.

71
00:53:15.994 --> 00:53:16.994
Amen.

72
00:53:16.994 --> 00:53:17.994
Praise the Lord.

73
00:53:17.994 --> 00:53:18.994
Hallelujah.

74
00:53:18.994 --> 00:53:20.994
Shall we give Jesus another round of applause?

75
00:53:20.994 --> 00:53:21.994
Thank you all.

76
00:53:21.994 --> 00:53:22.994
Thank you all.

77
00:53:22.994 --> 00:53:23.994
Praise the Lord.

78
00:53:23.994 --> 00:53:24.994
Thank you.

79
00:53:24.994 --> 00:53:25.994
Thank you.

80
00:53:25.994 --> 00:53:26.994
Hallelujah.

81
00:53:29.994 --> 00:53:30.994
Hallelujah.

82
00:53:30.994 --> 00:53:31.994
Praise the Lord.

